                <mxCell id="c848" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1a1a1a;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" value="Notes&lt;br&gt;• Supply: 3.0–3.6 V, at least 0.5 A.&lt;br&gt;• EN must not float (R3, C3).&lt;br&gt;• Strapping pins IO0, IO3, IO45, IO46: leave free at reset.&lt;br&gt;• IO35–37 are used by octal PSRAM on N8R8 / N16R8: not connected.&lt;br&gt;• USB: native, IO19 = D−, IO20 = D+ (no USB-serial chip).&lt;br&gt;• LCD on the FSPI IO MUX pins (IO10–12) for the fastest SPI clock.&lt;br&gt;• Antenna end: no copper under it, keep the battery and the&lt;br&gt;  display frame away (module datasheet keep-out)." vertex="1">
